{"id":"wb-6-620","name":"蒲松龄故宅","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"蒲松龄故居","text":"蒲松龄故居位于山东省淄博市淄川区洪山镇蒲家庄，是清代小说家蒲松龄的故居。包括故居旧址、附近住宅、柳泉以及墓园，现辟为蒲松龄纪念馆，介绍蒲松龄的生平以及其著作的影响，是全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%92%B2%E6%9D%BE%E9%BE%84%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":87812859,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87812859","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f7031efb912639e62401cd61.jpg","title":"Gate_of_pusongling's_house.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gate_of_pusongling%27s_house.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d2/Gate_of_pusongling%27s_house.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Finblanco","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​蒲松龄故居正门","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"蒲松龄故居"}}